### code pastes below | relative to git repo working dir == https://zq3q.org/repo/plar/

m4_esyscmd( bash -c 'set -x;pwd;git log --max-count=1 --date=short "--pretty=format:%ad commit: %h | %D"'  2>&1)

m4_esyscmd( bash -c 'set -x;ls -logrt ./plar.html ./js/plsPlayer.js ./js/config/plar.json' 2>&1)

m4_esyscmd( bash -c 'set -x;git status  plar.html js/plsPlayer.js' 2>&1)

---

./plar.html :

```
m4_include(plar.html)```

./package.json:

```
m4_include(./package.json)```

./js/plsPlayer.js:

```
m4_include(./js/plsPlayer.js)```

./js/config/plar.json :

```
m4_include(./js/config/plar.json)```

